@strong{triode.el} is a remote control interface to the Triode app (@uref{https://triode.app})@comma{} an internet radio station player for macOS@.

With @strong{triode.el}@comma{} you can control your listening to internet radio stations directly from GNU Emacs without need to change app focus.

If you enjoy using @strong{triode.el}@comma{} please consider buying me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

@image{images/default-yellow,,,,png}

